<metadata><name>Pacific Crest National Scenic Trail (PCT) from Highway 138 to the Mount Thielsen Trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:305-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.089043" lon="-122.091787"><ele>1805.5</ele><name>PCT trailhead on Highway 138</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:pct-hwy138 (OSM node 980041827, PCT crossing of OR 138); confidence: high; pdf_page: 307; quote: 4 miles north of the trailhead on Highway 138</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.153536" lon="-122.080762"><ele>2235.0</ele><name>PCT / Mount Thielsen Trail junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 980043658, shared by the Pacific Crest Trail and the Mount Thielsen Trail; confidence: high; pdf_page: 307; quote: 6 miles and a cumulative elevation gain of 2,000 feet to the junction with the Mount Thielsen Trail</desc></wpt>
